From: Andrew Yong <me@ndoo.sg>
Subject: [PATCH] modules/lvgl: remove duplicate vg_lite_matrix.c source

CMakeLists.txt unconditionally lists both
  src/debugging/vg_lite_tvg/vg_lite_matrix.c
and
  src/libs/vg_lite_driver/VGLite/vg_lite_matrix.c
Both compile to the same output basename, causing a duplicate-source
build error. Remove the debugging copy; the libs copy is canonical.
---
 modules/lvgl/CMakeLists.txt | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/modules/lvgl/CMakeLists.txt b/modules/lvgl/CMakeLists.txt
index aaaaaaa..bbbbbbb 100644
--- a/modules/lvgl/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/modules/lvgl/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -43,7 +43,6 @@ zephyr_library()
     ${LVGL_DIR}/src/debugging/test/lv_test_indev.c
     ${LVGL_DIR}/src/debugging/test/lv_test_indev_gesture.c
     ${LVGL_DIR}/src/debugging/test/lv_test_screenshot_compare.c
-    ${LVGL_DIR}/src/debugging/vg_lite_tvg/vg_lite_matrix.c

     ${LVGL_DIR}/src/display/lv_display.c
